  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "An angry man comes looking for Kostya. Max opens the door and a case of mistaken identity leads to threats. Let's listen closely to their exchange in Russian first, and then walk through each line together.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Здравствуйте.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anton",
      "t": "Константин Анисимов?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Да, это я.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "А вы интернет чинить?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anton",
      "t": "Я отец Насти.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anton",
      "t": "Обидишь Настю, я из тебя колбасу сделаю.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Подождите.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Вы неправильно поняли.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Я не Костя.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Я Макс.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "А я интернет чинить.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Кто из вас Константин?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anton",
      "t": "Я.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's hear this intense encounter.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Здравствуйте.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello.' A polite start to a hostile conversation.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anton",
      "t": "Константин Анисимов?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Konstantin Anisimov?' Checking the name.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Да, это я.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, that is me.' Max makes a huge mistake by lying.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "А вы интернет чинить?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you here to fix the internet?' Max was expecting a technician.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anton",
      "t": "Я отец Насти.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am Nastya's father.' The worst possible answer for Kostya's roommate.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anton",
      "t": "Обидишь Настю, я из тебя колбасу сделаю.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you hurt Nastya, I will turn you into sausage.' A very creative threat.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Подождите.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wait.' Max tries to backpedal quickly.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Вы неправильно поняли.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You understood incorrectly.' Trying to clear up the confusion.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Я не Костя.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am not Kostya.' He confesses the lie.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Я Макс.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am Max.' Offering his real name for safety.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "А я интернет чинить.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And I am here to fix the internet.' The real technician finally shows up.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Кто из вас Константин?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Which one of you is Konstantin?' Now the technician is confused.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anton",
      "t": "Я.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Me.' The real Kostya speaks up at last. Now let's hear the whole thing once more.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Здравствуйте.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
